Check strike placement/weight at your normal DPI and fonts, marker readability, top/bottom bar layout and menu, physical empty-item Tab/Shift+Tab, native title-bar close/minimize/maximize, Pin above other applications, relaunch geometry/pin restoration, tray Quit, and physical hotkey responsiveness. Multi-monitor/mixed-DPI restore and actual Windows hotkey/tray input were not manually exercised. No build/selftest blocker remains.
